    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**SETUP + PURPOSE**\n\n**Purpose:** Capture incoming leads automatically, standardize their information, validate required data, and save qualified submissions to a centralized lead database.\n\n**Setup Required:**\n\n* Connect Google Sheets credentials\n* Select the desired lead database spreadsheet\n* Map the required lead fields\n* Configure the webhook URL as the destination for the website, form, landing page, or other lead source\n* Publish the workflow and use the Production Webhook URL for live operation\n\n**Current Demo:** Webhook → Data Normalization → Validation → Google Sheets → Webhook Response\n\n",
        "height": 162,
        "width": 272
      },
      "id": "8c4d39cd-d50e-47bd-ae89-481c932c3cdb",
      "name": "SETUP + PURPOSE1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -64,
        -384
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "**WHAT IT DOES:**\n\nAutomatically captures inbound leads and stores their contact and inquiry information in a structured lead database.\n\n**HOW IT DOES IT:**\n\nReceives lead data through a webhook → standardizes the incoming fields → validates required information such as email → appends valid leads to Google Sheets → returns a response confirming the capture.\n\n**WHY PAY FOR IT:**\n\nEliminates manual lead entry, reduces lost or incomplete leads, centralizes prospect data, improves response speed, and creates a scalable foundation that can connect virtually any lead source to a CRM, spreadsheet, sales process, or follow-up automation.\n\n\n",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 320,
        "color": 5
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
